So my questions are:
1. Can you advise the easiest way to do callback from R to Java that
handles receiving data from Java to R. ( data <- self$in1$get_data("Int32")
).
2. Is it possible to use RServi in concurrent way that I could run R6
method and still during execution assign data to the same R6 field?

Hope, I didn't make my case unclear. Thanks for any advise,

Marek

